From: guf296 <guf296@126.com>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: typec: the TB321FU's two Type-C ports

PS5169 redriver, FSA4480 audio accessory sequence, a virtual WCD939x
USB switch, UCSI glink port select and audio accessory handling, dwc3
host quirks and PTN3222 tuning.

Taken from https://github.com/GUF296/linux branch TB321FU-7.1.1
(5df8e852e), the Lenovo Legion Tab Gen 3 / Y700 2025 (TB321FU) bring-up.
